# Cistern Hall's overflow channel (CIPlay cistern_hall_acid, 11-11; in a test world 'CI ...', under CIGapsWatchHealth,
# no CIGapsSuit). Points as in its recipe (the origin frame): the channel's mouth at the waterline under hill 1's south
# bank at 62 -64.3, dug in and up (15 deg) to 62 -54.3 and its small room to 62 -50.3; the acid zone ch_overflow at
# 62 -57 (r 3, safe=suit); the suit box at 53 -62.5 and the warning sign at 54 -61 on the bank west of the mouth; the
# overflow valve at 70.8 -62.5 on the bank east of it; the overflow locker at 62.9 -51.2. Without the suit the floor
# burns; the valve hides the zone, then the floor is safe. The suit run is cistern_hall_acidsuit.
island Cistern Hall keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

picture ch_flow_out 62 2.5 -72 62 1.5 -62
# In without a suit: the sludge burns
expect shown chflowacid
at 62 -64.6
walk 62 -64.6 to 62 -61 to 62 -57
wait 5
expect message acid sludge
expect hurt 15
picture ch_flow_in 62 2.4 -63.5 62 2.6 -55 light=20
walk 62 -57 to 62 -64.6
# (the way out is through the acid too: counted here, so the dry walk below starts from none)
expect hurt 1

# Along the bank to the valve (over the channel's roof): the sludge goes, the floor is safe
at 57 -60
walk 57 -60 to 68 -60 to 69.5 -62
use chflowvalve
wait 2
expect hidden chflowacid
at 62 -64.6
walk 62 -64.6 to 62 -61 to 62 -57 to 62.3 -52.4
wait 5
expect unhurt
open Overflow locker
wait 2
expect item Battery 1
